# Generated solver output (regenerated by mkpp AOT compiler)
# Generated solver headers are versioned so a fresh clone can build without a
# local Python generation step.  CI regenerates them from OpenAtmos sources.
# CI regenerates these before building to verify freshness.
mkpp-generated/*_manifest.json
mkpp-generated/**/*.json
mkpp-generated/*.png
mkpp-generated/report_*.md
mkpp-generated-*/
src/solvers/
.tmp*/

